    complex, -- information about the basic constructors
  * *note barycentricSubdivision(SimplicialMap,Ring,Ring):
    barycentricSubdivision_lpSimplicialMap_cmRing_cmRing_rp, -- create the map
    between barycentric subdivisions corresponding to a simplicial map

