|i24 : prune homology hC                                          |
|                                                                 |
|o24 = cokernel | x_3 x_1x_2 x_0x_2 x_0x_1 |                      |
|                                                                 |
|      0                                                          |
|                                                                 |
|o24 : Complex                                                    |
