|                 | 1 |                                                       |
|                 | 0 |                                                       |
|                 | 0 |                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : ComplexMap                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : kernel F == 0                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o12 = true                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

