    complex, -- information about the basic constructors
  * *note dual(MonomialIdeal): (Macaulay2Doc)dual_lpMonomialIdeal_rp, -- the
    Alexander dual of a monomial ideal
  * *note pdim(Module): (Macaulay2Doc)pdim_lpModule_rp, -- compute the
    projective dimension of a module
  * *note regularity(Module): (Macaulay2Doc)regularity, -- compute the
