faces(SimplicialComplex) -- get the list of faces for an abstract simplicial complex
************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note faces: (Polyhedra)faces,
  * Usage: 
        faces Delta
  * Inputs:
      * Delta, an *note abstract simplicial complex: SimplicialComplex,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, 

Description
===========

In this package, an abstract simplicial complex $\Delta$ is identified with a
squarefree monomial ideal in a *note polynomial ring:
ring_lpSimplicialComplex_rp,. The vertices of $\Delta$ correspond to a subset
of the variables in the polynomial ring, and each face is identified as the
product of the variables corresponding to the vertices of that face.  This
method function returns a *note HashTable: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable, whose keys
are the integers from $-1$ to $\operatorname{dim} \Delta$ and the value of the
key $i$ is the list containing the monomials corresponding to the
$i$-dimensional faces of $\Delta$.

The faces of the *note simplex: simplexComplex_lpZZ_cmPolynomialRing_rp,
correspond to all subsets of the underlying vertex set.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[x_0..x_3];                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Δ = simplexComplex(3, S)                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = simplicialComplex | x_0x_1x_2x_3 |                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : SimplicialComplex                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : faces Δ                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = HashTable{-1 => {1}                                }                    |
|               0 => {x , x , x , x }                                         |
|                      0   1   2   3                                          |
|               1 => {x x , x x , x x , x x , x x , x x }                     |
|                      0 1   0 2   0 3   1 2   1 3   2 3                      |
|               2 => {x x x , x x x , x x x , x x x }                         |
|                      0 1 2   0 1 3   0 2 3   1 2 3                          |
|               3 => {x x x x }                                               |
|                      0 1 2 3                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : HashTable                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : dim Δ                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 3                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : subsets vertices Δ                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {{}, {x }, {x }, {x , x }, {x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x , x }, {x },|
|            0     1     0   1     2     0   2     1   2     0   1   2     3  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x , x }, {x , x , x }, |
|       0   3     1   3     0   1   3     2   3     0   2   3     1   2   3   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {x , x , x , x }}                                                       |
|       0   1   2   3                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : assert(faces Δ === hashTable for i from -1 to 3 list                    |
|         i => first entries sub(matrix{rsort subsets(vertices Δ,             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|i+1)/product}, S))                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

The faces of the *note Bartnette sphere:
bartnetteSphereComplex_lpPolynomialRing_rp, are a proper subset of the
$7$-simplex.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : R = ZZ[a..h];                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : Γ = bartnetteSphereComplex R;                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : matrix {facets Γ}                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = | defh befh cdfh bcfh adeh abeh acdh abch defg cefg adfg acfg bdeg bceg |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     abdg abcg bcef acdf abde |                                              |
|                                                                             |
|             1      19                                                       |
|o9 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : faces Γ                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = HashTable{-1 => {1}                                                    |
|                0 => {a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h}                                |
|                1 => {a*b, a*c, a*d, a*e, a*f, a*g, a*h, b*c, b*d, b*e, b*f, |
|                2 => {a*b*c, a*b*d, a*b*e, a*b*g, a*b*h, a*c*d, a*c*f, a*c*g,|
|                3 => {a*b*c*g, a*b*c*h, a*b*d*e, a*b*d*g, a*b*e*h, a*c*d*f, a|
|                                                                             |
|o10 : HashTable                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|b*g, b*h, c*d, c*e, c*f, c*g, c*h, d*e, d*f, d*g, d*h, e*f, e*g, e*h, f*g, f*|
| a*c*h, a*d*e, a*d*f, a*d*g, a*d*h, a*e*h, a*f*g, b*c*e, b*c*f, b*c*g, b*c*h,|
|*c*d*h, a*c*f*g, a*d*e*h, a*d*f*g, b*c*e*f, b*c*e*g, b*c*f*h, b*d*e*g, b*e*f*|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|h}                                                                           |
| b*d*e, b*d*g, b*e*f, b*e*g, b*e*h, b*f*h, c*d*f, c*d*h, c*e*f, c*e*g, c*f*g,|
|h, c*d*f*h, c*e*f*g, d*e*f*g, d*e*f*h}                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                       }                     |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|c*f*h, d*e*f, d*e*g, d*e*h, d*f*g, d*f*h, e*f*g, e*f*h}                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : monomialIdeal Γ                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = monomialIdeal (b*c*d, a*c*e, c*d*e, a*b*f, b*d*f, a*e*f, c*d*g, a*e*g, |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      b*f*g, b*d*h, c*e*h, a*f*h, g*h)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : MonomialIdeal of R                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

There are two "trivial" simplicial complexes: the irrelevant complex has the
empty set as a facet whereas the void complex has no facets.

+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : irrelevant = simplicialComplex monomialIdeal gens S|
|                                                         |
|o12 = simplicialComplex | 1 |                            |
|                                                         |
|o12 : SimplicialComplex                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : faces irrelevant                                   |
|                                                         |
|o13 = HashTable{-1 => {1}}                               |
|                                                         |
|o13 : HashTable                                          |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : assert(faces irrelevant === hashTable{-1 => {1_S}})|
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i15 : void = simplicialComplex monomialIdeal 1_S         |
|                                                         |
|o15 = simplicialComplex 0                                |
|                                                         |
|o15 : SimplicialComplex                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : faces void                                         |
|                                                         |
|o16 = HashTable{}                                        |
|                                                         |
|o16 : HashTable                                          |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i17 : assert(faces void === hashTable{})                 |
+---------------------------------------------------------+

