    map_lpSimplicialComplex_cmSimplicialComplex_cmMatrix_rp, -- create a
    simplicial map between simplicial complexes
  * *note HH_ZZ SimplicialMap: HH_usZZ SimplicialMap, -- Compute the induced
    map on homology of a simplicial map.
  * *note homology(SimplicialComplex,Ring):
    homology_lpSimplicialComplex_cmRing_rp, -- compute the reduced homology of
    an abstract simplicial complex
  * *note HH_ZZ SimplicialComplex: HH_usZZ_lpSimplicialComplex_cmRing_rp, --
