========

  * *note Working with associated chain complexes: Working with associated
    chain complexes, -- information about the chain complexes and their
    homogenizations
  * *note HH SimplicialComplex: homology_lpSimplicialComplex_cmRing_rp, --
    compute the reduced homology of an abstract simplicial complex
  * *note HH_ZZ SimplicialComplex: HH_usZZ_lpSimplicialComplex_cmRing_rp, --
    compute the reduced homology of an abstract simplicial complex

