image(SimplicialMap) -- construct the image of a simplicial map
***************************************************************

  * Function: *note image: (Macaulay2Doc)image,
  * Usage: 
        image f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of abstract simplicial complexes: SimplicialMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an *note abstract simplicial complex: SimplicialComplex,, the image of
        the source of $f$ in the target of $f$

Description
===========

The image of $f$ is the subcomplex of the target of $f$ whose faces are of the
form $f(F)$ for some face $F$ in the source of $f$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/229[a,b,c];                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D = simplicialComplex{a*b*c}                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = simplicialComplex | abc |                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : SimplicialComplex                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : E = simplicialComplex{a*b,b*c}                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = simplicialComplex | bc ab |                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : SimplicialComplex                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : f = map(E,D,{a,b,a})                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = | a b a |                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : SimplicialMap simplicialComplex | bc ab | <--- simplicialComplex | abc ||
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isWellDefined f                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : image f                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = simplicialComplex | ab |                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : SimplicialComplex                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

