isSurjective(SimplicialMap) -- checks if a simplicial map is surjective
***********************************************************************

  * Function: *note isSurjective: (Macaulay2Doc)isSurjective,
  * Usage: 
        isSurjective f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of abstract simplicial complexes: SimplicialMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

Checks if every vertex in the target has a preimage.

Collapsing a triangle to an edge is surjective.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[a,b,c];                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : triangle = simplicialComplex {a*b*c}                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = simplicialComplex | abc |                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : SimplicialComplex                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : R' = ZZ[x_0,x_1];                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : edge = simplicialComplex {x_0*x_1}                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = simplicialComplex | x_0x_1 |                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : SimplicialComplex                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : f = map(edge,triangle,{x_0,x_0,x_1})                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = | x_0 x_0 x_1 |                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : SimplicialMap simplicialComplex | x_0x_1 | <--- simplicialComplex | abc |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
||                                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : isSurjective f                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

The identity map should always be surjective.

+------------------------------------+
|i7 : isSurjective id_triangle       |
|                                    |
|o7 = true                           |
+------------------------------------+
|i8 : assert isSurjective id_triangle|
+------------------------------------+

The inclusion of an edge in a triangle is not surjective.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : f' = map(triangle,edge,{a,b});                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : SimplicialMap simplicialComplex | abc | <--- simplicialComplex | x_0x_1 |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
||                                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : isSurjective f'                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = false                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : assert not isSurjective f'                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note Working with simplicial maps: Working with simplicial maps, --
    information about simplicial maps and the induced operations
  * *note isInjective(SimplicialMap): isInjective_lpSimplicialMap_rp, -- checks
    if a simplicial map is injective
  * *note id _ SimplicialComplex: id _us SimplicialComplex, -- make the
    identity map from a SimplicialComplex to itself

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note isSurjective(SimplicialMap): isSurjective_lpSimplicialMap_rp, --
    checks if a simplicial map is surjective
