    information about simplicial maps and the induced operations
  * *note source(SimplicialMap): source_lpSimplicialMap_rp, -- get the source
    of the map
  * *note target(SimplicialMap): target_lpSimplicialMap_rp, -- get the target
    of the map
  * *note image(SimplicialMap): image_lpSimplicialMap_rp, -- construct the
    image of a simplicial map
  * *note matrix(SimplicialMap): matrix_lpSimplicialMap_rp, -- get the
    underlying map of rings
  * *note map(SimplicialMap): map_lpSimplicialMap_rp, -- the underlying ring
    map associated to a simplicial map
  * *note isWellDefined(SimplicialMap): isWellDefined_lpSimplicialMap_rp, --
    whether underlying data is uncontradictory

Ways to use this method:
========================

