    complex, -- information about the basic constructors
  * *note vertices(SimplicialComplex): vertices_lpSimplicialComplex_rp, -- get
    the list of the vertices for an abstract simplicial complex
  * *note facets(SimplicialComplex): facets_lpSimplicialComplex_rp, -- get the
    list of maximal faces

