    substitute_lpSimplicialComplex_cmPolynomialRing_rp, -- change the ring of a
    simplicial complex
  * *note wedge: wedge_lpSimplicialComplex_cmSimplicialComplex_cmRingElement_
    cmRingElement_rp, -- make the wedge sum of two abstract simplicial
    complexes

