    complex, -- information about the basic constructors
  * *note Finding attributes and properties: Finding attributes and properties,
    -- information about accessing features of an abstract simplicial complex
  * *note Working with simplicial maps: Working with simplicial maps, --
    information about simplicial maps and the induced operations
